  "title": "RYANAIR & GOOGLE CLOUD ANNOUNCE FIVE-YEAR DATA AND AI PARTNERSHIP",
  "summary": "EUROPE’S LARGEST AIRLINE ADOPTS GOOGLE CLOUD’S DATA AND AI PLATFORM – INCLUDING GEMINI ENTERPRISE AND GOOGLE WORKSPACE – SUPPORTING INFRASTRUCTURE RESILIENCE & OPERATIONS Ryanair, Europe’s largest airline, and Google Cloud today (Wed, 12 Aug) announced a new five-year partnership. Under the agreement, Ryanair will deploy Google Workspace and Google Cloud services to 35,000 employees across its network to support its growth to 300 million passengers p.a. by 2034. This rollout includes Gemini Enterprise – Google […]",
